id: pm-github-4cuz
title: Repeated dependency phrases rescan failed reference spans
description: "Separate parser-level follow-up from PR 158 regex backtracking fixes. parseDependencyReferences in index.ts restarts a linear sticky reference scan at every dependency phrase. Synthetic body \"blocks.\" repeated 6000 times (42000 characters, no references) takes 1906.303 ms. Each individual regex attempt is linear, but repeated failed scans revisit the same suffix; this is outside the adjacent-overlapping-quantifier and end-anchored-trim patch. Preserve existing phrase and reference grammar while reusing failed-scan boundaries."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags[2]: dependencies,performance
