updated_at: "2026-10-20T13:58:48.600Z"
author: codex-agent
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "Add adversarial repeated-phrase scaling coverage, preserve dependency reference values and ordering, and prevent suffix rescans from multiplying with phrase count."
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-20T13:58:48.597Z",codex-agent,"Discovered during PR 158 regex review; tracked separately from pm-github-lfcf. Read-only synthetic reproduction: parseDependencyReferences(\"blocks.\".repeat(6000), \"fixture/project\") returns zero references after 1906.303 ms. Each sticky match is individually linear, but failed spans are rescanned at subsequent phrases. No parser algorithm change is included in the regex patch."
